        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A traditional stone built farmhouse set on a 1.7 acre plot located on the outskirts of Loughanure Village. The property has been vacant for many years and requires a major renovation. This house should qualify for the 70,000 derelict property grant plus the SEAI energy upgrade grants subject to meeting all attached conditions and will be a dream renovation project for someone. Set off the main road a little and accessed via a small shared laneway you have both the benefits of peaceful tranquility. Plus all local amenities within a few minutes walk. The grounds comprise a mixture of natural woodland plus an area of hill grazing. All enquires welcome. BER pending."
